  "project_description": "The Contrib Todo List module provides a collaborative task management system directly integrated into Drupal nodes. It allows content editors and reviewers to create, share, and track todos specific to content items, making content management and review processes more efficient.\n\n Requirements \n \n History module \n Option module \n \n Features \n \n Create todos associated with specific nodes and elements within the content \n Share todos with other contributors \n Track todo status \n Language-specific todos for multilingual sites \n Permission-based access control \n \n \n\n Post-Installation \n \n Enable the module through the Extend page \n Grant the \"Manage todo list\" permission to appropriate roles \n Place the \"Contrib todo list\" block in your theme's region \n Visit any node page to start creating todos \n Back to top",
